      "beat_id": "C01",
      "act": "Act 1",
      "narration_text": "The legacy CNN baseline was severely overfit. It memorized the training data, hitting ninety-nine percent accuracy, but only achieved fifty-three point seven percent on the test set. We needed a new architecture.",
