            "artifactHeading": "Beating the Baseline",
            "artifactLines": [
              "Architecture swapped: Implemented a 1D-ResNet model with vastly superior capacity and feature extraction.",
              "Data augmentation injected: Random rolling, noise addition, and signal scaling applied to prevent memorization.",
              "Regularization success: Training accuracy dropped to a healthier 82.46%, forcing the network to learn actual patterns.",
              "Validation breakthrough: Validation loss hit an incredibly low 0.6683 while test accuracy climbed to 66.90%."
            ]
